  "summaries": [
    {
      "id": 20621,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "Dynatrace allows customers to set up a webhook integration in order to automatically send updates to a specific endpoint of choice. This submission identified a way how the setup made it possible to accidentally obtain AWS metadata. Dynatrace remediated the vulnerability and found no evidence of abuse associated with it. \n\nThis is also mentionend in https://www.dynatrace.com/support/help/whats-new/release-notes/managed/sprint-186/. ",
